00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:16,460
Although a sweet kitty cat would be nice, too!

260
00:23:16,460 --> 00:23:18,460
Meow, meow!

261
00:23:18,460 --> 00:23:20,460
That might be even better!

262
00:23:20,460 --> 00:23:21,460
Wait, maybe...

263
00:23:21,460 --> 00:23:23,460
Something a little more wild and fierce,

264
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:24,460
like a wolf!

265
00:23:24,460 --> 00:23:27,460
All men are wolves sometimes, baby!

266
00:23:27,460 --> 00:23:28,460
No, it's impossible!

267
00:23:28,460 --> 00:23:30,460
They simply can't choose!

268
00:23:30,460 --> 00:23:32,460
None of the above!

269
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:37,460
These creatures are disgusting!

270
00:23:37,460 --> 00:23:39,460
But there's no time to waste being squeamish now!

271
00:23:39,460 --> 00:23:42,460
We must keep the Clover Kingdom's people safe!

272
00:23:42,460 --> 00:23:46,460
Black Clover, page 22, wild magic dance!

273
00:23:46,460 --> 00:23:49,460
Anybody who's been injured, please come see me!

